    "title": "Folk school to resume operation out of historic home in downtown Fayetteville - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stacy Ryburn ,\n5 hours ago FAYETTEVILLE — The folk school will continue playing on at a historic downtown home. The city’s Advertising and Promotion Commission voted 6-0 on Monday to adopt a letter of intent with Ozark Folkways to operate Folk School of Fayetteville out of the Walker-Stone House. The commission owns the Civil War-era home, located southwest of Center Street and Church Avenue. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
